#: lib/install-selection.sh:165
msgid ""
"Installs the WMI hotkey daemon for ScreenPad brightness, fan Quiet/Balanced/"
"Performance, camera privacy, and window swap across monitors."
msgstr ""
"Jinstalla d-daemon tal-hotkeys WMI għall-luminożità tal-ScreenPad, fann "
"Quiet/Balanced/Performance, privatezza tal-kamera, u swap tat-twieqi bejn il-"
"monitors."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:169
msgid ""
"Installs the speaker amplifier fix and a suspend/resume hook so supported "
"ZenBook audio recovers after boot and after sleep."
msgstr ""
"Jinstalla l-iffissar tal-amplifier tal-kelliem u hook suspend/resume sabiex "
"l-awdjo ZenBook appoġġjat jirkupra wara l-boot u wara l-irqad."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:167
msgid ""
"Installs the touchpad Share gesture listener so a top-left corner tap opens "
"your desktop screenshot tool (GNOME, Spectacle, and peers)."
msgstr ""
"Jinstalla l-listener tal-gesture Share tat-touchpad biex tap fil-kantuniera "
"fuq ix-xellug tiftaħ l-għodda ta' screenshot tad-desktop (GNOME, Spectacle, "
"u simili)."

